#. <CLT 3>江ノ島盾子<CLT>さん…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "<CLT 3>Junko<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. 彼女の致命傷って…
#. 戦刃むくろの<CLT 3>致命傷と似てる<CLT>よね？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wasn't her fatal injury <CLT 3>pretty similar<CLT> to Mukuro's?"
msgstr ""

#. 似てるって…どういう意味？
msgctxt "0003 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "What do you mean...?"
msgstr ""

#. だって、江ノ島さんって…
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Well, remember what happened to her?"
msgstr ""

#. 全身をたくさんの槍で貫かれて、
#. 殺されちゃったんだよね…？
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"She was impaled by a bunch of spears, all over her\n"
"body."
msgstr ""

#. 戦刃むくろの致命傷は、
#. 全身にある数多くの傷…
msgctxt "0006 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"And Mukuro died from a number of wounds across her\n"
"body..."
msgstr ""

#. 江ノ島盾子の致命傷は、
#. 全身を貫いた数多くの槍…
msgctxt "0007 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"When you compare that to the stab wounds Junko\n"
"suffered..."
msgstr ""

#. に、似ているどころか…一致してる…？
msgctxt "0008 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Then the s-similarities...match...?"
msgstr ""

#. そう、その２人の致命傷“だけ”が、
#. 奇妙に一致しているのよ…
msgctxt "0009 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Yes, and those are the *only* fatal injuries that\n"
"match up."
msgstr ""

#. それが理由よ…
#. それらの死体が同一人物だと考えられる理由…
msgctxt "0010 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"That explains why those \"two\" bodies are actually one\n"
"and the same."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、こういう事か…
msgctxt "0011 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "So let me see if I have this straight..."
msgstr ""

#. あの時、全身を無数の槍に貫かれ、
#. 江ノ島盾子として殺された死体は…
msgctxt "0012 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Junko, or someone going by that name, was stabbed to\n"
"death with multiple spears."
msgstr ""

#. しばらく生物室に安置された後で、
#. 再び引っ張り出され…
msgctxt "0013 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Then her body was kept in the bio lab for however\n"
"long, before being dragged out again."
msgstr ""

#. 今度は、戦刃むくろの死体として、
#. 俺達の前に現れた。
msgctxt "0014 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Only this time, it was presented as the corpse of one\n"
"Mukuro Ikusaba."
msgstr ""

#. それなら、つじつまも合うよね？
#. ここ数日のものじゃない傷が、死体の致命傷でもさ…
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It all matches up, right? Those wounds Junko suffered\n"
"could easily be these same injuries."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、マジなんか？　戦刃むくろの死体と
#. 江ノ島っちの死体は、同一人物のもので…
msgctxt "0016 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Then...it's really true? Mukuro and Junko are the same\n"
"person...?"
msgstr ""

#. …あれ？　だとすると…
msgctxt "0017 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Wait, so then..."
msgstr ""

#. …んんっ？　どういう事になるんだ！？
msgctxt "0018 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Nng! What does it all mean!?"
msgstr ""

#. 犠牲者の数が１０人ではなく、
#. 実際は９人だったとなると…
msgctxt "0019 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It means that there haven't been ten victims, but\n"
"nine."
msgstr ""

#. 死んだと思われていた人間の中に、
#. “実は生きている人間”が存在している事になる。
msgctxt "0020 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Which also means that among the people we thought were\n"
"dead...one is still alive."
msgstr ""

#. …って事は、それが黒幕の正体なんだね！？
msgctxt "0021 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "...And that's the true identity of the mastermind!?"
msgstr ""

#. 誰だべ！？　誰が黒幕なんだ！？
msgctxt "0022 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Who is it!? Who's behind all this!?"
msgstr ""

#. そんなの…決まってるじゃない…！
#. 戦刃むくろ…あいつが生きてるのよ…ッ！！
msgctxt "0023 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"We already kn-know the answer to that... It's Mukuro!\n"
"Sh-She's still alive!"
msgstr ""

#. あ、あいつは…
#. 最初に殺された江ノ島の死体を使って…
msgctxt "0024 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "She took J-Junko's body..."
msgstr ""

#. 自分が死んだと…見せかけてたのよ…！
msgctxt "0025 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "...and made it look like she was th-the one who died!"
msgstr ""

#. つまり、戦刃むくろはまだ生きてる…！
#. ま、間違いないわ…ッ！！
msgctxt "0026 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "S-So Mukuro is still alive. She's g-gotta be!"
msgstr ""

#. ……………
msgctxt "0027 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. も、黙秘…？
#. 図星ね…図星なのね…？
msgctxt "0028 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Total silence...? Then I m-must be right...! I'm\n"
"right, aren't I?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>戦刃むくろは…生きている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Mukuro...alive?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>生きているのは…戦刃むくろ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The one that's still alive is Mukuro...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも…本当に…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Nhưng...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>本当に…それでいいのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Can we really believe that?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、そうじゃないはずだ。
#. 戦刃むくろが生きているとは考えられない…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No, there's no way. There's no way Mukuro Ikusaba is\n"
"still alive!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
